<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4f6c1782c23e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Documents presented to Parliament by Human Services Minister Alan Tudge showed the use of automated data matching processes by Centrelink and the Department of Human Services resulted in 19,980 debt notices being issued, all of which were either reduced or rescinded." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "915" .

